## Day 9 — Wed Jul 15 · The shopping day (Harajuku/Omotesandō + Akihabara)
**Headline:** Your dedicated **shopping & explore day** — this is where the big buys happen (sneakers, electronics, watches, cosmetics, toys). All in walkable A/C clusters. **Fuji override:** if Jul 15's forecast is clearer than Jul 17, run the **Day 11 Fuji timeline** today instead and do this shopping day on Jul 17.

<div class="tl">

<div class="stop"><div class="tmark">Night before</div><div class="scard">
<div class="stitle">🌦️ Decide: Fuji today, or shop today?</div>
<div class="sbody"><b>If Jul 15 looks clearer than Jul 17</b> → run the <b>Day 11 Fuji timeline</b> today and move this shopping day to Jul 17. Otherwise, shop today (Fuji odds are fickle in July — Part 8).</div>
</div></div>

<div class="stop meal"><div class="tmark">08:00</div><div class="scard">
<div class="stitle">🍳 Breakfast → out by 09:30</div>
