<div class="facts"><span class="f tap">🟩 TAP SUICA</span><span class="f">JR Yamanote</span><span class="f"><b>~25 min</b></span><span class="f">~¥210</span></div></div>
</div></div>

<div class="stop"><div class="tmark">10:15</div><div class="scard">
<div class="stitle">👟 ZONE 1 — Harajuku &amp; Omotesandō (sneakers, cosmetics, toys)</div>
<div class="sbody">One long, mostly-flat walk down Omotesandō. All tax-free with passport (¥5,000 min pre-tax).
<ul class="picklist">
<li><span class="tg buy">SHOES</span><span class="nm">Nike Harajuku</span> — flagship, Japan-exclusive colourways. Know your US/cm sizes. <a href="https://www.nike.com/retail/s/nike-harajuku">nike.com/nike-harajuku</a></li>
<li><span class="tg buy">SHOES</span><span class="nm">Onitsuka Tiger Omotesandō (Yellow Concept Store)</span> — the flagship; the buy-in-Japan classic. <span class="maplink">📍 Maps: "Onitsuka Tiger Omotesando"</span></li>
<li><span class="tg buy">SKIN</span><span class="nm">@cosme TOKYO (Harajuku)</span> — Japan's biggest cosmetics store, English help, tax-free counter. Bring your shelf photos. <span class="maplink">📍 Maps: "@cosme TOKYO"</span></li>
<li><span class="tg buy">KIDS</span><span class="nm">Kiddy Land Harajuku</span> — 5-floor toy/character mecca (Sanrio, Ghibli, Pokémon), tax-free. <a href="https://trulytokyo.com/kiddyland/">Kiddy Land</a></li>
</ul>
<div class="sphoto"><img src="images/jul2/1c092ab9.jpg" alt="Cosmetics stores"><span class="cap"><b>@cosme TOKYO</b>Biggest cosmetics store, Harajuku.</span></div></div>
</div></div>

<div class="stop meal"><div class="tmark">12:30</div><div class="scard">
<div class="stitle">🍽️ Lunch + long A/C break</div>
<div class="sbody">Ain Soph has a Harajuku-area branch — easy midpoint before Zone 2.
<ul class="picklist">
<li><span class="tg veg">VEG</span><span class="nm">Ain Soph. (Ginza / Shinjuku / Ikebukuro)</span> — fully vegan café; heavenly pancakes, burgers, bento. <span class="warn">⚠️ book ahead — it fills.</span> <a href="https://www.ain-soph.jp/">ain-soph.jp</a></li>
<li><span class="tg veg">VEG</span><span class="nm">T's TanTan (Tokyo Station, Keiyō St)</span> — 100% vegan ramen, no egg/dairy/dashi — if you loop via Tokyo Stn. <span class="maplink">📍 Maps: "T's TanTan Tokyo Station"</span></li>
</ul></div>
</div></div>

<div class="stop move"><div class="tmark">14:00</div><div class="scard">
